Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}字幕製作：測試樣本組
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天怎麼這麼早就起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,SEC,,0,0,0,,Why are you up so early today?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,我睡不著 乾脆起來煮點咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep,\Nso I figured I'd make some coffee.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,ZH,,0,0,148,,你要不要也來一杯 我煮了一大壺\N夠我們兩個人喝一整個上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,SEC,,0,0,0,,Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot,\Nenough for both of us to drink all morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,好啊 - 加不加糖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,- Sure. - Sugar?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,ZH,,0,0,148,,樓下那家店的手機殼打八折\N我昨天順手買了一個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,SEC,,0,0,0,,The shop downstairs has phone cases\Nat 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,一共是128.50元 比網上便宜了差不多30塊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,It came to 128.50 in total,\Nabout 30 cheaper than online.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我\N可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.20,SEC,,0,0,0,,There's something I've been meaning to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我\N可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.10,SEC,,0,0,0,,I might move closer to work next month.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,嗯 每天通勤兩個小時 實在是太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Two hours of commuting\Nevery day is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.60,Lyrics_EN,,0,0,0,,♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪
